{% comment %}
    MESSAGES PAGE: SERIES BROWSE — the second of the messages page's two
    blocks (Assets/Lava/MessagesLatest.lava is the first).

    Block:                    HTML block in the Main zone, below the latest message
    Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/SeriesBrowse.lava' %}
    Enabled Lava Commands:    RockEntity, Sql
    Cache Duration:           600 or so: the list only changes when a series
                              starts (a new series shows within 10 minutes)

    Every started series in channel 4 that has a SeriesImage, expired or
    not (the archive keeps past series; expire dates are for promotion),
    newest first, as cards: the series graphic, title and start month. The
    detail view adds two tabs under the title: Description (the default; a
    truncated Content) and Messages (links straight to each message, from
    one SQL query for every series at once). Tabs only when a series has
    both; otherwise whichever it has shows on its own.

    Behaviour (theme.js, "Series browse"):
      Grid / Detail   the view toggle; the choice is remembered per browser
      Description / Messages  the detail view's tabs (without JavaScript both
                      panels show, one under the other)
      Show more       the server renders every series; the browser shows the
                      first `batchSize` and reveals the next batch as the
                      "Show more" button scrolls into view (or is pressed).
                      Hidden cards' images aren't requested; shown ones load
                      lazily (loading="lazy"). Without JavaScript every card
                      shows, in the grid view.

    Series links go to /watch/previous-messages/{slug} (the series' primary
    slug; `seriesUrlBase`). A series without a slug links to the base page.
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} ===== SETTINGS ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign seriesChannelId = 4 -%}
{%- assign seriesUrlBase = '/watch/previous-messages/' -%}
{%- assign batchSize = 12 -%}
{%- assign descLength = 220 -%}

{%- assign now = 'Now' | Date:'yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss' -%}

{%- comment -%}
    Every series' messages in one query, one row per series: Messages is
    "title^slug|title^slug…", oldest first. A message counts once it has
    started and has a video (VimeoMedia), the rule used everywhere else; its
    slug is its primary (first) one.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% sql return:'seriesMessages' %}
    DECLARE @ItemEntityTypeId int = ( SELECT [Id] FROM [EntityType] WHERE [Name] = 'Rock.Model.ContentChannelItem' );
    SELECT ser.[Id] AS [SeriesId],
        STUFF( (
            SELECT '|' + REPLACE( REPLACE( m.[Title], '|', '' ), '^', '' ) + '^' + ISNULL( sl.[Slug], '' )
            FROM [ContentChannelItemAssociation] ca
            INNER JOIN [ContentChannelItem] m ON m.[Id] = ca.[ChildContentChannelItemId]
            CROSS APPLY ( SELECT TOP 1 s.[Slug] FROM [ContentChannelItemSlug] s WHERE s.[ContentChannelItemId] = m.[Id] ORDER BY s.[Id] ) sl
            WHERE ca.[ContentChannelItemId] = ser.[Id]
              AND m.[ContentChannelId] = 5
              AND m.[StartDateTime] <= GETDATE()
              AND EXISTS (
                  SELECT 1 FROM [AttributeValue] av
                  INNER JOIN [Attribute] a ON a.[Id] = av.[AttributeId]
                  WHERE a.[Key] = 'VimeoMedia' AND a.[EntityTypeId] = @ItemEntityTypeId
                    AND av.[EntityId] = m.[Id] AND ISNULL( av.[Value], '' ) <> '' )
            ORDER BY m.[StartDateTime]
            FOR XML PATH( '' ), TYPE ).value( '.', 'nvarchar(max)' ), 1, 1, '' ) AS [Messages]
    FROM [ContentChannelItem] ser
    WHERE ser.[ContentChannelId] = {{ seriesChannelId }}
{% endsql %}

{%- assign seriesCount = 0 -%}
{%- capture seriesCards -%}
{% contentchannelitem where:'ContentChannelId == {{ seriesChannelId }} && StartDateTime <= "{{ now }}"' sort:'StartDateTime desc' %}
    {%- for series in contentchannelitemItems -%}
        {%- assign imageGuid = series | Attribute:'SeriesImage','RawValue' | Trim -%}
        {%- if imageGuid == '' %}{% continue %}{% endif -%}
        {%- assign seriesCount = seriesCount | Plus:1 -%}
        {%- assign seriesUrl = seriesUrlBase | Append:series.PrimarySlug -%}
        {%- assign seriesDesc = series.Content | StripHtml | HtmlDecode | Trim | Truncate:descLength -%}
        {%- assign seriesRow = seriesMessages | Where:'SeriesId', series.Id | First -%}
        {%- assign seriesMessageList = seriesRow.Messages | Default:'' | Split:'|' -%}
        {%- assign seriesMessageCount = seriesMessageList | Size %}
      <li class="series-card" data-card>
        <div class="series-card__media">
          <img src="/GetImage.ashx?guid={{ imageGuid }}&w=720&h=405&mode=crop" width="720" height="405" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="series-card__body">
          <h3 class="series-card__title"><a href="{{ seriesUrl }}" data-card-link>{{ series.Title }}</a></h3>
          <p class="series-card__date">{{ series.StartDateTime | Date:'MMMM yyyy' }}</p>
          {%- if seriesDesc != '' or seriesMessageCount > 0 %}
          {%- comment -%} Detail view only: Description / Messages tabs (theme.js "Tabs") when the series has both; otherwise the one it has {%- endcomment %}
          <div class="series-card__more" data-tabs>
            {%- if seriesDesc != '' and seriesMessageCount > 0 %}
            <div class="series-card__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="{{ series.Title | Escape }}" hidden>
              <button class="series-card__tab" type="button" role="tab" id="st-{{ series.Id }}-about" aria-controls="sp-{{ series.Id }}-about" aria-selected="true">Description</button>
              <button class="series-card__tab" type="button" role="tab" id="st-{{ series.Id }}-messages" aria-controls="sp-{{ series.Id }}-messages" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Messages <span>({{ seriesMessageCount }})</span></button>
            </div>
            {%- endif %}
            {%- if seriesDesc != '' %}
            <div class="series-card__panel" id="sp-{{ series.Id }}-about" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="st-{{ series.Id }}-about">
              <p class="series-card__desc">{{ seriesDesc | Escape }}</p>
            </div>
            {%- endif %}
            {%- if seriesMessageCount > 0 %}
            <div class="series-card__panel" id="sp-{{ series.Id }}-messages" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="st-{{ series.Id }}-messages">
              <ol class="series-card__messages" role="list">
                {%- for entry in seriesMessageList -%}
                    {%- assign entryParts = entry | Split:'^' %}
                <li><a class="series-card__message" href="{{ seriesUrl }}/{{ entryParts[1] }}"><span class="series-card__week">{{ forloop.index }}</span> {{ entryParts[0] | Escape }}</a></li>
                {%- endfor %}
              </ol>
            </div>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
{% endcontentchannelitem %}
{%- endcapture -%}

<section class="sermons sermons-series" aria-labelledby="sermons-series-title" data-series-browse data-batch="{{ batchSize }}">

  <div class="sermons-divider">
    <h2 id="sermons-series-title">All series</h2>
  </div>

  {%- if seriesCount > 0 %}
  <div class="sermons-series__bar">
    <p class="sermons-series__count">{{ seriesCount }} series</p>
    <div class="view-toggle" role="group" aria-label="View" data-view-toggle hidden>
      <button type="button" class="view-toggle__btn" data-view="grid" aria-pressed="true">Grid</button>
      <button type="button" class="view-toggle__btn" data-view="detail" aria-pressed="false">Detail</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="sermons-series__list" data-series-list data-view="grid" role="list">
    {{ seriesCards }}
  </ul>

  <div class="sermons-series__more">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-series-more hidden>Show more series</button>
  </div>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="sermons-series__count">Series are on their way. Check back soon.</p>
  {%- endif %}

</section>
